    rdf:value """Saturday, Nov. 30, 1907
I Tatti.
Dull.
Massage. Walk.
Lina came in in the morning, looking very beautiful in a large green hat. The darling little boy was with her, who gave Bernhard a “Bears’ Hug”."""^^xsd:string ;
